{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":30,"type":"xterm-256color"},"timestamp":1791908960,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"larn","title":"Larn","env":{"LANG":"C.UTF-8","TERM":"xterm-256color","COLORTERM":"truecolor"}}
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[4;11H\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[4;11H\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[4;11H    Welcome to the game of Larn.  At this moment, you face a great problem.\u001b[5;11HYour daughter has contracted a strange disease, and none of your home remedies\u001b[6;11Hseem to have any effect.  You sense that she is in mortal danger, and you must\u001b[7;11Htry to save her.  Time ago you heard of a land of great danger and opportunity.\u001b[8;11HPerhaps here is the solution you need.\u001b[9;11H\u001b[10;11H    It has been said that there once was a great magician who called himself\u001b[11;11HPolinneaus.  Many years ago, after having many miraculous successes, Polinneaus\u001b[12;11Hretired to the caverns of Larn, where he devoted most of his time to the\u001b[13;11Hcreation of magic.   Rumors have it that one day Polinneaus set out to dispel\u001b[14;11Han attacking army in a forest some distance to the north.  It is believed that\u001b[15;11Hhere he met his demise.\u001b[16;11H\u001b[17;11H    The caverns of Larn, it is thought, must be magnificent in design,\u001b[18;11Hand contain much magic and treasure.  One option you have is to undertake a\u001b[19;11Hjourney into these caverns.\u001b[20;11H\u001b[21;11H\u001b[22;11H    Good Luck!  You're going to need it!\u001b[23;11H\u001b[24;11H\u001b[25;11H\u001b[26;11H\u001b[27;11H\u001b[27;11HPress \u001b[7mreturn\u001b[27m to continue: "]
